                                                "sense_id": "b1bae561-06c7-327c-81d4-5b7b21db1b99",
                                                "text": "[…] as the Baker case shows, saying that no physical attacks actually occur and that the cyberrape or cyberharassment is just \"words\" would not ease the feeling of violation."
                                            },
