                                                "sense_id": "b1bae561-06c7-327c-81d4-5b7b21db1b99",
                                                "text": "Similar to the stalking behaviors of an unknown assailant, this type of cyberharassment can cause undue anxiety and hypervigilance in the victim."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a089f81b-f2f1-424f-b1e5-bb1f47c343b6",
                                                "sense_id": "b1bae561-06c7-327c-81d4-5b7b21db1b99",
                                                "text": "Cyberbullying can also target adults such as parents or teachers. Cyberbullying can easily escalate into cyberharassment or cyberstalking..."
                                            }
